    "body": "Stopped before claiming: the prerequisites are not on an allowed base.\n\n- #1862 (Sketch ECS entity, `.camproj` persistence, `ImportDxf`) is open, with no PR and no branch. This issue selects sketch chains and layers on that entity, so it cannot start without it.\n- #1864 (the body says \"Depends on #1864\") is open, with no PR.\n- #1861 is PR #2106 (`chain()`, open). Stacking on it alone does not give the Sketch entity, and a second stacking level is not allowed.\n\nI made no claim, worktree, code change or gate run. The next attempt can start once #1862 is merged or is an open PR.\n",
